# Instagram Influencer Performance Analysis

## Project Overview

This project focuses on analysing Instagram influencer performance through data collection, data transformation, analytical measures, and interactive dashboard development.

The project applies business intelligence and data visualization techniques to examine influencer performance indicators, identify engagement patterns, and present analytical insights through a structured dashboard.

## Objectives

- Analyse Instagram influencer performance data.
- Collect and prepare data for analytical processing.
- Transform raw data into a structured analytical dataset.
- Develop DAX measures for performance analysis.
- Design interactive dashboards to visualize influencer performance.
- Identify patterns and derive insights from dashboard results.

